'''Old tools''' are found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] in resource rooms. A set can also be found outside a shack, north of the beehives in [[Kastori]]. Players can take a [[Rake|rake]], [[Spade|spade]], or [[Seed dibber|seed dibber]] from the rack. Unlike [[Tools (gardening)|gardening tools]], a seed dibber can also be looted.

